1🔢 “Human🧍, speak🗣️ to➡️ Israel’s🇮🇱 mountains🏔️. Tell🗣️ them👥, ‘Mountains🏔️ of➡️ Israel🇮🇱, hear👂 the💯 LORD’s👑 word📨—gbọ́👂🇳🇬.
